The Big Picture — What Happens When You Run
----------------------------------------------------------------
Think of it like a relay race:

  TEST 1 (new-submission)
    → Creates a submission
    → Verifies the new tab that opens
    → Saves the submission details to a file
    → Hands off to TEST 2

  TEST 2 (submission-overview)
    → Reads the saved submission details
    → Navigates to it
    → Verifies the top bar matches

  TEST 3 (insured-information)
    → Reads the same saved submission
    → Navigates to General Information → Insured tab
    → Verifies all insured fields

  TEST 4 (policy-information)
    → Reads the same saved submission
    → Navigates to Policy tab
    → Verifies dates, policy number, policy type

  TEST 5 (broker-information)
    → Reads the same saved submission
    → Navigates to Broker tab
    → Tests email validation, commission, counter
